ct outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.","ArrayExpression",["191"],"eqeqeq","Expected '===' and instead saw '=='.","BinaryExpression","unexpected",["189"],["190"],"'AlertMessage' is defined but never used.",["189"],["190"],"jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/evcohen/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/master/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","JSXOpeningElement","'token' is assigned a value but never used.","'config' is assigned a value but never used.","Array.prototype.map() expects a return value from arrow function.","expectedInside","Expected '!==' and instead saw '!='.",["189"],["190"],"'SubMenu' is assigned a value but never used.","'useEffect' is defined but never used.","'Option' is assigned a value but never used.","'visible2' is assigned a value but never used.","'setVisibledropship' is assigned a value but never used.","'data' is assigned a value but never used.",["189"],["190"],["189"],["190"],"'useState' is defined but never used.",{"desc":"192","fix":"193"},"no-global-assign","no-unsafe-negation",{"desc":"194","fix":"195"},"Add dependencies array: [props]",{"range":"196","text":"197"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [props, store]",{"range":"198","text":"199"},[982,982],", [props]",[1011,1013],"[props, store]"]